---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import abdulKalam from '../../assets/images/abdul-kalam.png';
---

<BaseLayout title="Beyond the Lab" description="A bit more about Jyothish J. Kumar outside of work.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <a class="back-link" href="/about/">&larr; Back to About</a>
      <span class="eyebrow">Beyond the lab</span>
      <h1>A bit more about me</h1>

      <p>
        I'm originally from Aranmula, Pathanamthitta, in Kerala, but grew up in Ajmer, Rajasthan —
        which means I speak Hindi, Malayalam, and English fluently, and think of both states as home.
        I come from a family of four: my father is a retired army serviceman, my mother is a nurse,
        and I have an elder sister.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside of building robots, I like to DIY things — making things is genuinely my favourite
        hobby. I also enjoy music (an amateur, self-taught harmonium and guitar player), driving, and
        cooking. I like a good, learned debate about a topic I'm interested in, and I'm mildly
        obsessed with having a systematic arrangement for everything.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container inspirations">
      <div class="prose">
        <span class="eyebrow">Inspiration</span>
        <h2>Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam</h2>
        <p>
          Dr. Abdul Kalam is my idol — his journey, his words, and his genius are something that
          keeps me moving. His autobiography, <em>Wings of Fire</em>, has been my soul food for a
          long time.
        </p>
        <blockquote>
          "Every age has a hero, and every hero has a story."
          <footer>— Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam, the "Rocket Man of India"</footer>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
      <Image src={abdulKalam} alt="Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam" width={320} height={282} densities={[1, 1.5, 2]} />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .inspirations {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 0.7fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .inspirations :global(img) {
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    justify-self: center;
  }
  .inspirations blockquote footer {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-style: normal;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .inspirations { grid-template-columns: 1fr; text-align: center; }
  }
</style>
